## 4. Slice conclusion

Every load-bearing argument actually displayed here is built from finite residue fields, exact valuation heights, uniformizers, Newton/MacLane-style residual reads, unit substitutions, and assembled graded digits. The notes explicitly handle the two places where positive characteristic matters: discriminant-zero/inseparable legs and vanishing binomial coefficients. I found no mathematical obstruction at \(\mathbf F_q[[t]]\).

Thus these four notes need no new mathematics for equal characteristic. They need three terminology edits and an external scope audit of the named supplier interfaces before they alone can certify the entire capstone’s all-DVR quantifier.

